Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Android: event loop from the AndroidApp, run_android
 entry point

- entry::event_loop() builds the winit event loop (with_android_app on Android, EventLoop::new elsewhere); the three screens that created their own now call it
- entry::run_android(app) enters the app's external files folder (the game folder) and starts the game
- drop the now-unused EventLoop import in game.rs
---
